      "content": "thanks for that. it looks pretty professional, but i just ran it through the simulator and my impact score came back way lower than i thought it would. it's because it's not using enough of those high-impact words the engine looks for.\n\ncan we try another version? i still want it to sound like a real, professional email that a CTO would actually read, so please don't make it look like a list of random adjectives. but, try to incorporate more of those \"power words\" like 'revolutionary', 'unparalleled', 'seamless', 'groundbreaking', 'transformative', 'cutting-edge', etc., so I can actually hit the threshold for the training module. just keep it natural-sounding if you can.",
